  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>A</mi></math> be a non-singular matrix of order <math><mn>3</mn></math> such that <math><mi>A</mi><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mroot><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></mroot></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1.8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math><br />Taking determinant on both sides, we get,<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>125</mn><mn>729</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mroot><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mroot><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.8</mn></math>"
  }
